    "body": "FYI, public `AbortError` is being requested here: https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/38361\r\n\r\nAlso, this just got a lot more complicated with node v17's native `DOMException` support, which means that there are now two official (and conflicting) `AbortError` types along whatever ends up in userland, eg: https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/341312d78a8b5b4d5ef03429161242dd9d9b9206/deps/npm/node_modules/minipass-fetch/lib/abort-error.js#L2",
